# Files in the repo that are NOT part of the distributed modpack.
# packwiz indexes the whole pack directory by default; this keeps maintainer
# tooling, credentials, and build output out of the exported .mrpack / .zip.
# (README.md, CHANGELOG.md, and docs/ are intentionally NOT ignored — they are
# small, player-readable, and have shipped since v1.0.)

# Publish automation + its docs
scripts/
PUBLISHING.md

# Safety net: TBS-Client is a Fabric modpack, plugins/ should always be empty.
# `cf install <slug>` of a Bukkit-category project (e.g. Simple Voice Chat)
# drops a stray .pw.toml here that poisons the CurseForge manifest with a
# Bukkit project reference — CF rejects modpacks containing such references.
# Ignore plugins/ so a stray cf install can't break a release.
plugins/

# Credentials
.env
.env.example

# Claude Code / repo guidance — not player-facing
CLAUDE.md

